          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilikana maũndũ aa, we Yakovo, na Isilaeli; nũndũ wĩ mũthũkũmi wakwa: nĩnakũmbie; wĩ mũthũkũmi wakwa: we Isilaeli, ndikolwa nue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩnĩvutĩte mavĩtyo maku ta ĩthweo ĩkamu, na ta ĩthweo, naĩ syaku: nzyokea; nũndũ nĩngwovoetye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
